[00:23.00]1. Jehovah God is my Shepherd;
[00:28.14]I’ll follow where he will lead.
[00:34.84]He knows my hopes and my heart’s desire;
[00:40.80]He knows what I truly need.
[00:47.44]To watered pastures he leads me,
[00:54.52]To places secure and blessed.
[01:00.76]And he guides me always with loyal love
[01:07.18]To where I find peace and rest.
[01:13.66]He guides me always with loyal love
[01:20.02]To where I find peace and rest.
[01:30.42]2. Refreshing are all your pathways,
[01:37.04]The ways of your righteousness.
[01:43.52]For your name’s sake never let me stray
[01:49.44]From walking in faithfulness.
[01:57.44]In valleys deep in the shadows,
[02:02.70]Assured by your staff and rod,
[02:09.08]I will fear no danger of lasting harm,
[02:16.26]For you are my Friend and God.
[02:22.28]I fear no danger of lasting harm,
[02:28.70]For you are my Friend and God.
[02:39.55]3. Jehovah, you are my Shepherd;
[02:45.73]I follow where you will lead.
[02:52.19]You strengthen me, and you give me rest;
[02:58.26]You give all I truly need.
[03:03.71]As you most surely are living,
[03:03.73]So sure is my hope in you.
[03:03.73]May your loyal love and your care for me
[03:03.73]Pursue me my whole life through.
